Reason: give TRIX its own processed root (data/roots/trix/) so the relation-graph cache in processed/data.pt cannot be shared with another repo's pre_transform. Upstream hardcodes the absolute paths /output and /kg-datasets/, which exist in no container here. No jinja default is supplied on purpose: util.parse_args marks every template variable required, so a default would be silently unreachable and the caller must state both paths.

diff --git a/config/run_entity_inductive.yaml b/config/run_entity_inductive.yaml
index 1eecf29..575ad63 100644
--- a/config/run_entity_inductive.yaml
+++ b/config/run_entity_inductive.yaml
@@ -1,8 +1,8 @@
-output_dir: /output
+output_dir: {{ output_dir }}
 
 dataset:
   class: {{ dataset }}
-  root: /kg-datasets/
+  root: {{ data_root }}
   version: {{ version }}
 
 model:
